ServiceName IN ("PSEXEC*", "PAExec*", "RemCom*", "CSEXEC*", "ATSVC*") ImagePath IN ("*\\ADMIN$*", "*\\C$\\Windows\\*", "*\\Users\\Public\\*", "*\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\*", "*\\Windows\\Temp\\*") OR NOT (Computer IN ("MGMT-*", "SCCM-*", "DEPLOY-*", "ADMIN-*") OR User IN ("*svc_*", "*admin_*", "*deploy*", "*sccm*", "*ansible*", "*pdq*") OR ImagePath IN ("*\\Windows\\CCM\\*", "*\\Microsoft Configuration Manager\\*", "*\\PDQ\\*", "*\\Ivanti\\*", "*\\ManageEngine\\*", "*\\Tanium\\*"))
